"C<fd>, up to and including its C<TRAILER!!!> entry, and returns the offset "
"of the byte following it, rounded up to the next 512-byte boundary (early "
"cpio archives are padded to a block boundary before the next archive is "
"appended).  Returns C<-1> if the archive is truncated or malformed."
msgstr ""

