"L<guestfs-python(3)>, L<guestfs-recipes(1)>, L<guestfs-ruby(3)>, L<http://"
"libguestfs.org/>, L<http://caml.inria.fr/>."
msgstr ""
"L<guestfs(3)>, L<guestfs-examples(3)>, L<guestfs-erlang(3)>, L<guestfs-"
