"libguestfs generated file\n"
" WARNING: THIS FILE IS GENERATED FROM THE FOLLOWING FILES:\n"
"          generator/c.ml\n"
"          and from the code in the generator/ subdirectory.\n"
" ANY CHANGES YOU MAKE TO THIS FILE WILL BE LOST.\n"
