" g = guestfs.GuestFS(python_return_dict=True)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: python/examples/guestfs-python.pod:25
msgid ""
"This indicates that your program wants to receive Python dicts for methods "
"in the API that return hashtables."
